% Enemy on a floor that is both an edge and fragile; a pusher and a quaker.
linked(x1, x2). linked(x2, x1).
edge(x1, void). fragile(x1, sewer). fragile(x1, pit).
companion(a). companion(b).
at(a, x2). at(b, x2).
knows(a, shove). knows(b, stomp).
skillKind(shove, push). skillKind(stomp, quake).
at(orc, x1).
